#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for Qiskit Runtime {#logging-for-qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr "Qiskit Runtime 로깅 {#logging-for-qiskit-runtime}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as Qiskit Runtime, generate platform logs that"
" you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your "
"account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit Runtime과 같은 IBM Cloud&reg; 서비스는 플랫폼 로그를 생성합니다. 이 로그를 사용하여 계정의 비정상적인 "
"활동 및 중요한 작업을 조사하고 문제를 해결할 수 있습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use [IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-"
"router?topic=logs-router-about), which is a platform service, to route "
"platform logs in your account to a destination of your choice by configuring"
" a tenant that defines where platform logs are sent. For more information, "
"see [About Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-"
"router-about).\n"
msgstr ""
"[IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-"
"router-about)은 플랫폼 서비스로, 플랫폼 로그를 전송할 위치를 정의하는 테넌트를 구성하여 계정의 플랫폼 로그를 원하는 대상으로"
" 라우팅하는 데 사용할 수 있습니다. 자세한 내용은 [Logs Routing "
"정보](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about)를 "
"참조하세요.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) to "
"visualize and alert on platform logs that are generated in your account and "
"routed by IBM Cloud Logs Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"[IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs)를 사용하면 계정에서 생성되고 IBM "
"Cloud Logs Routing을 통해 IBM Cloud Logs 인스턴스로 라우팅된 플랫폼 로그를 시각화하고 알림을 설정할 수 "
"있습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Locations where platform logs are generated {#locations-where-platform-logs-"
"are-generated}"
msgstr "플랫폼 로그가 생성되는 위치 {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Cloud Container Registry generates platform logs that are displayed in "
"your logging instances. The following table lists the locations where the "
"automatic collection of Container Registry service logs is enabled.\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Cloud Container Registry는 로깅 인스턴스에 표시되는 플랫폼 로그를 생성합니다. 다음 표에는 Container "
"Registry 서비스 로그의 자동 수집이 활성화된 위치가 나열되어 있습니다.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Location                   | Are platform services logs available? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                  Yes                  |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                  Yes                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 위치                        | 플랫폼 서비스 로그 사용 가능 여부 |\n"
"|-----------------------------|----------------------------------|\n"
"| 워싱턴 D.C. (us-east)      | 예                               |\n"
"| 프랑크푸르트 (eu-de)        | 예                               |\n"

